cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Metlabs Regulatory Index"
abstract: >-
  Regulatory assessment of 122 jurisdictions (97 countries and territories,
  23 US states and 2 UAE emirates) for businesses that provide crypto-asset
  services or tokenize assets: weighted score across five dimensions,
  authorities, latest regulatory change and review dates.
authors:
  - name: "Metlabs"
    website: "https://metlabs.io/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23873539"
url: "https://metlabs.io/en/blockchain-regulation/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MetlabsBlockchain/blockchain-regulation-index"
keywords:
  - blockchain regulation
  - crypto regulation
  - MiCA
  - VASP
  - CASP
  - tokenization
